        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Strengthening Awareness and Funding Education for Grilling Act or SAFE Grilling Act</strong></p><p>This bill requires the Consumer Product Safety Commission to develop and implement a public awareness campaign about the dangers associated with cooking using a grill and best practices for using a grill safely to prevent injuries and fires.</p>",
